  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Sei tu <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂilla Detective?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650069002000740075002000100003110000FF02020069006C006C00610020004400650074006500630074006900760065003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esatto",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073006100740074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sono <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿఌil sostitutola sostituta",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006E006F002000100003110000FF0C0C0069006C00200073006F007300740069007400750074006F006C006100200073006F00730074006900740075007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se ti manda Matière, allora mi fido.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650020007400690020006D0061006E006400610020004D00610074006900E800720065002C00200061006C006C006F007200610020006D00690020006600690064006F002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vado subito al sodo! Ho visto una cosa tremenda!\nProprio qui, capisci? A Luminopoli!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho visto...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F00200076006900730074006F002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "UN ENORME...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055004E00200045004E004F0052004D0045002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... BUNNELBY!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E002000420055004E004E0045004C00420059002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era un Bunnelby fuori dal comune, grande più\ndel doppio rispetto al mio. E poi gli occhi...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBrillavano in modo veramente minaccioso!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Appena ho incrociato il suo sguardo, sono\nscappato a gambe levate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHo viaggiato in diverse regioni e ne ho viste tante,\nma è la prima volta che ho avuto così tanta paura!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma la cosa peggiore è dove l’ho visto!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nUna stradina secondaria molto normale...\nmica dentro una zona selvaggia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non perdiamo tempo! Bisogna intervenire subito.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Attiva l’indicatore<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> per la mia missione e\nraggiungimi sul posto!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh... Mi tremano le ginocchia...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuel Bunnelby enorme... l’ho visto proprio da\nqueste parti.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bun?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006E003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Che c’è, amico mio? Non mi dire che...\nÈ qui?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006500200063201900E8002C00200061006D00690063006F0020006D0069006F003F0020004E006F006E0020006D0069002000640069007200650020006300680065002E002E002E000A00C80020007100750069003F002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUNNEEE!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E004E00450045004500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È GIGANTE!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C800200047004900470041004E00540045002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "INQUIETANTE!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049004E005100550049004500540041004E00540045002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "PAZZESCO!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500041005A005A004500530043004F002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È lui! Non ci sono dubbi!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C80020006C0075006900210020004E006F006E00200063006900200073006F006E006F002000640075006200620069002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUN BUNNEEEL!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E002000420055004E004E004500450045004C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non ci posso credere! Hai sconfitto quel Bunnelby\ngigante!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E00200063006900200070006F00730073006F0020006300720065006400650072006500210020004800610069002000730063006F006E0066006900740074006F0020007100750065006C002000420075006E006E0065006C00620079000A0067006900670061006E00740065002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sai, guardando come lottavi mi sono ricordato di\nuna cosa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610069002C0020006700750061007200640061006E0064006F00200063006F006D00650020006C006F007400740061007600690020006D006900200073006F006E006F0020007200690063006F0072006400610074006F002000640069000A0075006E006100200063006F00730061002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tanto tempo fa, in una regione di cui non ricordo\nil nome, c’erano dei Pokémon enormi e violenti,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon gli occhi che brillavano. Li chiamavano <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>alfa<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come mai adesso ci ritroviamo con dei Pokémon\ncome quelli a Luminopoli?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNon riesco proprio a capire...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu che dici, amico mio? Non hai anche tu\nun brutto presentimento?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000630068006500200064006900630069002C00200061006D00690063006F0020006D0069006F003F0020004E006F006E002000680061006900200061006E006300680065002000740075000A0075006E002000620072007500740074006F002000700072006500730065006E00740069006D0065006E0074006F003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Neeel...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006500650065006C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comunque, ti ringrazio davvero. Capisco perché\nMatière ti ha affidato il caso.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCon una persona come te in città, possiamo stare\ntranquilli anche se arrivano dei Pokémon alfa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
